1
00:00:00,962 --> 00:00:06,262
(Howard:)We'd just show him the closet and
let the goblins in his head take it from there.

2
00:00:08,203 --> 00:00:09,363
(Howard:)Hey, guys, come on in.

3
00:00:09,538 --> 00:00:12,128
(Howard:)- Hi.
- Ooh, it smells good.

4
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:15,210
Thanks. Sheldon, I know tonight's
the night you eat Thai food.

5
00:00:15,377 --> 00:00:18,607
(Bernadette:)I went to the Asian market,
got the ingredients, made it from scratch.

6
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,710
(Sheldon:)Oh, you shouldn't have.

7
00:00:20,882 --> 00:00:22,142
It was my pleasure.

8
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:24,440
(Sheldon:)No, you really shouldn't have.

9
00:00:24,853 --> 00:00:26,653
(Sheldon:)I brought my own.

10
00:00:27,556 --> 00:00:29,146
(Bernadette:)You stopped and got him takeout?

11
00:00:29,357 --> 00:00:32,657
(Leonard:)I had no choice.
He kept kicking the back of my seat.

12
00:00:32,928 --> 00:00:34,918
(Bernadette:)Sheldon, I've been cooking all day.

13
00:00:35,097 --> 00:00:37,427
Well, now don't you feel silly?

14
00:00:40,368 --> 00:00:43,018
(Howard:)Show him the closet.

